<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia 1996 Jan-Sept tea exports rise 29.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Indonesia 1996 Jan-Sept tea exports rise 29.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's tea exports rose 29.8 percent to $75 million in the first nine months of 1996 from $57.8 million and $63.8 million in the same 1995 and 1994 periods respectively.</p>
<p>The Finance Ministry released the data ahead of President Suharto's unveiling of the 1997/98 (April-March) state budget in parliament on Monday. -- Jakarta newsroom + 6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
